# Module Generator

> Fuente: https://laravelmodules.com/docs/13/resources/laravel-module-generator
> Exportado: 2026-07-23 (manual)

Package: `dcblogdev/laravel-module-generator` — generate modules from templates.

## Install

```bash
composer require dcblogdev/laravel-module-generator
php artisan vendor:publish --provider="Dcblogdev\ModuleGenerator\ModuleGeneratorServiceProvider"
```

Config templates (default stubs under `stubs/module-generator`):

- Breeze - Blade - CRUD Web & API
- Breeze - Blade - CRUD Web only
- Breeze - Blade - CRUD API only

## Usage

```bash
php artisan module:build
php artisan module:build Contacts "Breeze - CRUD API only"
php artisan module:enable Contacts
composer dump-autoload
```

## Placeholders

**Filenames:** `Module`, `module`, `module_plural`, `Model`, `model`

**Inside files:** `{Module}`, `{module}`, `{module_}`, `{module-}`, `{module }`, `{Model}`, `{model}`, `{model_}`, `{model-}`, `{model }`
